        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Leveraging our strong brand recognition, massive member traffic, and robust technology infrastructure, we have pioneered a business operating system designed to enhance hotel operations across all fronts.",
        "start_character": 7469,
        "end_character": 7673
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048058",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048058-5d731f912df98d68",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048058",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business operating system is the result of our years of industry know-how, and it includes innovative ideas that are first tested and refined by our leased and owned business.",
        "start_character": 7674,
        "end_character": 7853
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048058",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048058-5d731f912df98d68",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048058",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Scope of service: the services that we provide to franchised hotels are similar to those we provide to manachised hotels, except that we do not appoint managers and do not provide management services to the franchised hotels.",
        "start_character": 38545,
        "end_character": 38770
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048058",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048058-5d731f912df98d68",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048058",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The hotel industry in the countries and regions where we operate business, including China, is subject to a number of laws and regulations, including laws and regulations relating specifically to hotel operation, management and commercial franchising, and travel agency business, as well as those relating to environmental and consumer protection.",
        "start_character": 76794,
        "end_character": 77141
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048058",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048058-5d731f912df98d68",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048058",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "This section summarizes the principal regulations in the countries and regions we operate that are currently relevant to our business and operations.",
        "start_character": 78097,
        "end_character": 78246
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048058",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048058-5d731f912df98d68",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048058",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Today, as one of the most sought-after brands in the upper midscale segment, IntercityHotel has achieved comprehensive coverage across core first- and second-tier cities in China, offering the discerning business traveler an ideal journey defined by “Work Efficiently, Live Effortlessly.” As of December 31, 2025, we had 159 IntercityHotels in operation and an additional 111 IntercityHotels under development.",
        "start_character": 18385,
        "end_character": 18795
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048058",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048058-5d731f912df98d68",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048058",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have a dedicated information security center that provides other departments with professional data security and risk management services.",
        "start_character": 57503,
        "end_character": 57649
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048058",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048058-5d731f912df98d68",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048058",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide our franchisees with services such as central reservation, sales and marketing support, technology support, quality assurance inspections, and other operational support and information.",
        "start_character": 35453,
        "end_character": 35654
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048058",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048058-5d731f912df98d68",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048058",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continuously strengthened guest safety management, service quality, and data privacy protection, ensuring a trusted and secure environment.",
        "start_character": 73436,
        "end_character": 73578
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048058",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048058-5d731f912df98d68",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048058",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manage our manachised hotels and impose the same standards on all manachised hotels as our other hotels to ensure product quality and consistency across our hotel network.",
        "start_character": 34633,
        "end_character": 34807
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048058",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048058-5d731f912df98d68",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048058",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a global multi-brand hotel group, we remain committed to integrating sustainability into our long-term development.",
        "start_character": 67903,
        "end_character": 68021
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048058",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048058-5d731f912df98d68",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048058",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
